## Why This Is Asked

Assesses design of a cross-cluster DR workflow using Kubernetes-native primitives, including CRD design, operator pattern, and practical backup/restore sequencing.

## Key Concepts

- CustomResourceDefinition and Operator pattern
- etcd and application data backup strategies
- Cross-cluster replication and restore validation
- Observability: metrics, logs, traces; restoreVerified condition

